# Mode one: a land card found is put onto the battlefield tapped (CR 701.23), not into the hand. A Mox Emerald is neither a
# creature nor a land card, so it cannot be found (the refusal), and the Forest, a land card, can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Archdruid's Charm
Plains x5
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Plains x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Archdruid's Charm.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Search(Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Revealed = Forest
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Archdruid's Charm; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
